|i2 : setRandomSeed "nice example 2";                                        |
| -- setting random seed to 12638458417381289481402307077                    |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C=randomChainComplex({1,1,1},{2,2})                                    |
|                                                                            |
|       3       5       3                                                    |
|o3 = ZZ  <-- ZZ  <-- ZZ                                                     |
|                                                                            |
|     0       1       2                                                      |
|                                                                            |
|o3 : Complex                                                                |
