|i4 : C.dd                                                                   |
|                                                                            |
|           3                              5                                 |
|o4 = 0 : ZZ  <------------------------- ZZ  : 1                             |
|                | -14 -7  5 5   3   |                                       |
|                | 8   13  1 -17 -21 |                                       |
|                | -13 -15 1 18  21  |                                       |
|                                                                            |
