histogram -- histogram of a list of real numbers
************************************************

  * Usage: 
        h = histogram(L,n)
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of numbers in RR or QQ or ZZ
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the number of subintervals to
        be considered.
  * Outputs:
