maximalEntry -- maximal absolute value of the entries of the matrix or matrices
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        m = maximalEntries C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, or a *note Matrix:
        (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, over ZZ, QQ, or RR
  * Outputs:
      * m, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of the maximal absolute values of
        the entries in matrices defining the differential

Description
===========

For each matrix we compute the of maximal absolute value of the entries

