normalize -- normalize a Complex over QQ or RR
**********************************************

  * Usage: 
        B = normalize C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, over RR or QQ
  * Outputs:
      * B, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, an isomorphic Complex over QQ
        or RR

Description
===========

We divide each matrix by its entry of maximal absolute value, to obtain a
complex with entries of absolute size $\le 1$.

