+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C.dd                                                 |
|                                                          |
|           3                              5               |
|o3 = 0 : ZZ  <------------------------- ZZ  : 1           |
|                | -14 -7  5 5   3   |                     |
|                | 8   13  1 -17 -21 |                     |
|                | -13 -15 1 18  21  |                     |
|                                                          |
|           5                        3                     |
|     1 : ZZ  <------------------- ZZ  : 2                 |
