testTimeForLLLonSyzygies -- test timing for LLL on syzygies
***********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        (m,t1,t2)=testTimeForLLLonSyzygies(r,n,Height=>100)
  * Inputs:
      * r, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Height => an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, default value 11, the
        sizes of the random integers used
  * Outputs:
      * m, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of maximal absolute values of the
        entries of A, B and the LLL basis of B
      * t1, a *note real number: (Macaulay2Doc)RR,, the time in seconds to
        compute B = ker A
      * t2, a *note real number: (Macaulay2Doc)RR,, the time to compute the LLL
        basis of B

Description
===========

We randomly choose an $r \times\ n$ matrix A over ZZ with entries up to the
given Height, and take the time to compute B=ker A and an LLL basis of B.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : setRandomSeed "nice example 2";                                         |
| -- setting random seed to 12638458417381289481402307077                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : r=10,n=20                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = (10, 20)                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : (m,t1,t2)=testTimeForLLLonSyzygies(r,n,Height=>11)                      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = ({5, 2.91596e52, 9}, .00219686, .00104693)                              |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (m,t1,t2)=testTimeForLLLonSyzygies(15,30,Height=>100)                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = ({50, 2.30853e454, 98}, .00641379, .0440248)                            |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : L=apply(10,c->(testTimeForLLLonSyzygies(15,30))_{1,2})                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {(.0064179, .014708), (.00699067, .00658813), (.00755661, .00922962),   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (.00781673, .0132745), (.00717642, .0174641), (.00704361, .0167375),    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (.00608146, .0106481), (.00627316, .010088), (.00543463, .00713445),    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (.00693316, .0108371)}                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
