WithLLL -- Option for randomComplex
***********************************

Description
===========

If WithLLL=>true then syzygy matrices of the randomly chosen matrices are
improved for their Height by applying the LLL algorithm.

Functions with optional argument named WithLLL:
===============================================

  * "randomChainComplex(...,WithLLL=>...)" -- see *note randomChainComplex:
    randomChainComplex, -- random chain complex over the integers with
    prescribed ranks of the homology group and ranks of the matrices

For the programmer
==================

The object *note WithLLL: WithLLL, is a *note symbol: (Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,.

